Subject: [PATCH 26/34] SSBU: the PS4's device answers in ac_ps4_info.h, shared
 with a PC build (AC_PS4_HOST_IDENTITY: ac_linux_drm.c answers as the console,
 conditional rendering off) that fills the PS4's shader cache

